


### Get Own Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Own Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/user/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_updated",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg",
  "status": "away"
}

### Search Users by Username
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/search?username=john
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Users (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/user/all
Content-Type: application/json

### Deactivate User (Admin Only)
# Replace :id with actual user ID
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/user/user/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isUserActive": false
}

### Reactivate User (Admin Only)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/user/user/64f1c2e3a1b2c3d4e5f60001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isUserActive": true
}